nd MSG7 (2 modules), all with zero failures/static mismatches. The final 25-file source comparison and full compiler accounting preserve all 1,351 nonprivate constant types/metadata/axiom closures and 168 owned simp rules. Scoped opacity checks and paired controls are recorded with their exact source generations.\n\nGate 106 round 3 is published and ready for the selected Codex audit. **Not yet clear to merge: external audit open.** The [gate pack](https://github.com/Shilun-Allan-Li/tcslib/blob/complexity/arora-barak-ch3-4/campaign/gates/106-sg1-dedup/pack-r3.md) distinguishes the seven accepted cleanup kinds, the separate fixed-live-stop ruling, inherited admissions and remaining bounded comparisons. Seyoon merges after gate closure and current replay validity.\n","created_at":"2026-11-06T07:32:12Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T03:29:22Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c967cce1bcfedd1ece4c7a789bd012b9b502d0d7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shilun-Allan-Li/tcslib/pulls/215/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shilun-Allan-Li/tcslib/pulls/215/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shilun-Allan-Li/tcslib/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shilun-Allan-Li/tcslib/issues/215/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shilun-Allan-Li/tcslib/statuses/79e7c63a6bfa5f002663924f5c7d4e72db705026","head":{"label":"Shilun-Allan-Li:lean/dedup-sg1","ref":"lean/dedup-sg1","sha":"79e7c63a6bfa5f002663924f5c7d4e72db705026","user":{"login":"Shilun-Allan-Li","id":47707803,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzA3ODAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47707803?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shilun-Allan-Li","html_url":"https://github.com/Shilun-Allan-Li","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shilun-Allan-Li/followers","fo